---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Architectural Design Competition Models | Carve Model"
  description="Architectural competition models developed with designers, from preliminary concepts to presentation, with material studies and flexibility for review changes."
  canonicalPath="/design-competition-models"
  ogTitle="Architectural Design Competition Models | Carve Model"
  ogDescription="Architectural competition models developed with designers, from preliminary concepts to presentation, with material studies and flexibility for review changes."
  active="services"
  imageSlot={true}
>
<Fragment slot="head">
<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline set:html={`{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Service","@id":"https://www.physical-model.com/design-competition-models#service","url":"https://www.physical-model.com/design-competition-models","name":"Design Competition Models","serviceType":"Architectural design competition models","description":"Architectural competition models developed with designers, from preliminary concepts to presentation, with material studies and flexibility for review changes.","provider":{"@id":"https://www.physical-model.com/#organization"},"areaServed":[{"@type":"Country","name":"United States"},{"@type":"Country","name":"Canada"}],"isPartOf":{"@id":"https://www.physical-model.com/#website"},"breadcrumb":{"@id":"https://www.physical-model.com/design-competition-models#breadcrumb"}}`} />
<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline set:html={`{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"BreadcrumbList","@id":"https://www.physical-model.com/design-competition-models#breadcrumb","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Home","item":"https://www.physical-model.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Services","item":"https://www.physical-model.com/scale-model-services"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Architectural & Real Estate Models","item":"https://www.physical-model.com/architectural-scale-models"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":4,"name":"Design Competition Models","item":"https://www.physical-model.com/design-competition-models"}]}`} />
<style>
.breadcrumb{padding-top:1.6rem;}
.breadcrumb a{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.8rem;letter-spacing:0.04em;color:var(--cm-text-subtle);transition:color var(--dur-2);}
.breadcrumb a:hover{color:var(--cm-text-strong);}
.page-hero{padding-top:1.6rem;padding-bottom:clamp(2.5rem,4vw,4rem);border-bottom:1px solid var(--cm-line-faint);}
.page-hero h1{margin-top:1.4rem;}
.page-hero h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--cm-text-muted);}
.page-hero p{margin-top:1.4rem;}
.page-hero__inner{display:grid;grid-template-columns:0.85fr 1.15fr;gap:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,3rem);align-items:center;}
@media(max-width:900px){.page-hero__inner{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.page-hero__visual{order:-1;max-width:440px;}}
.page-hero__visual{position:relative;}
.page-hero__visual image-slot{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:4/3;}
.page-hero__visual .corner{position:absolute;width:14px;height:14px;border:1px solid var(--cm-silver);opacity:0.5;z-index:3;}
.page-hero__visual .corner.tl{top:-1px;left:-1px;border-right:0;border-bottom:0;}
.page-hero__visual .corner.br{bottom:-1px;right:-1px;border-left:0;border-top:0;}
.hero__spec{position:absolute;right:-12px;bottom:24px;z-index:4;background:var(--cm-ink-800);border:1px solid var(--cm-border-strong);padding:0.9rem 1.1rem;box-shadow:var(--shadow-lg);}
.hero__spec .tick{display:block;}
.hero__spec strong{font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:var(--w-bold);color:var(--cm-text-strong);font-size:1.15rem;letter-spacing:-0.01em;}
.hero__cta{display:flex;gap:0.9rem;flex-wrap:nowrap;margin-top:1.8rem;}
@media(max-width:560px){.hero__cta{flex-wrap:wrap;}}
.hero__cta .btn--primary,.hero__cta .btn--ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--cm-text-strong);border:1px solid var(--cm-border-strong);}
.hero__cta .btn--primary:hover,.hero__cta .btn--ghost:hover{background:var(--cm-accent);color:var(--cm-accent-contrast);border-color:var(--cm-accent);}
.svc-all-btn{background:transparent;color:var(--cm-text-strong);}
.svc-all-btn:hover{background:var(--cm-accent);color:var(--cm-accent-contrast);border-color:var(--cm-accent);}
.dedi-media{margin-top:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);}
.dedi-media image-slot{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:21/9;}
.dedi-body{padding-block:clamp(3rem,5vw,5rem);}
.dedi-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:clamp(2rem,4vw,4rem);align-items:start;}
.dedi-grid h2{font-size:clamp(1.6rem,2.8vw,2.4rem);letter-spacing:-0.02em;}
.dedi-list{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:1.4rem 0 0;display:grid;gap:0.8rem;}
.dedi-list li{display:flex;gap:0.7rem;align-items:flex-start;font-size:1rem;color:var(--cm-text-muted);}
.dedi-list li svg{flex:none;margin-top:4px;color:var(--cm-silver);}
@media(max-width:820px){.dedi-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
.svc-section{padding-block:clamp(3rem,5vw,5rem);border-bottom:1px solid var(--cm-line-faint);}
.svc-section h2{font-size:clamp(1.6rem,2.8vw,2.4rem);letter-spacing:-0.02em;margin-top:1rem;}
.svc-section .lead-p{margin-top:1.2rem;max-width:68ch;}
.svc-checklist{list-style:none;padding:0;margin:1.8rem 0 0;display:grid;gap:0.75rem;max-width:68ch;}
.svc-checklist li{display:flex;gap:0.7rem;align-items:flex-start;font-size:1rem;color:var(--cm-text-muted);}
.svc-checklist li svg{flex:none;margin-top:4px;color:var(--cm-silver);}
.svc-types{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.6rem);margin-top:2rem;}
.svc-type{padding-top:0;border-top:0;}
.svc-type__media{margin-bottom:0.9rem;}
.svc-type__media image-slot{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:4/3;}
.svc-type h3{font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:var(--w-semibold);color:var(--cm-text-strong);letter-spacing:-0.01em;}
.svc-type p{margin-top:0.5rem;color:var(--cm-text-muted);font-size:0.9rem;max-width:none;}
@media(max-width:760px){.svc-types{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
.svc-steps{display:grid;gap:0;margin-top:2rem;max-width:68ch;}
.svc-step{display:grid;grid-template-columns:2.4rem 1fr;gap:1rem;padding-block:1rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--cm-line-faint);}
.svc-step:last-child{border-bottom:0;}
.svc-step__n{font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.9rem;color:var(--cm-text-subtle);padding-top:0.15rem;}
.svc-step p{color:var(--cm-text-muted);font-size:1rem;}
.svc-note{margin-top:1.4rem;color:var(--cm-text-muted);max-width:68ch;}
.formats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--cm-line-faint);border:1px solid var(--cm-line-faint);margin-top:1.8rem;}
.fmt{position:relative;background:var(--cm-ink-900);padding:1.4rem 1rem;text-align:center;font-family:var(--font-mono);font-size:0.8rem;color:var(--cm-gray-300);letter-spacing:0.03em;transition:background var(--dur-3),color var(--dur-3);}
.fmt:hover{background:var(--cm-ink-850);color:var(--cm-text-strong);}
@media(max-width:760px){.formats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}}
@media(max-width:480px){.formats{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
.svc-split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr;gap:clamp(2rem,4vw,4rem);align-items:start;}
.svc-split .svc-checklist,.svc-split .lead-p{max-width:none;}
.svc-split__media image-slot{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:4/5;}
@media(max-width:900px){.svc-split{grid-template-columns:1fr;}.svc-split__media{order:-1;max-width:440px;}}
.svc-split--rev{grid-template-columns:0.9fr 1.1fr;}
.svc-split--rev .svc-split__media{order:-1;}
@media(max-width:900px){.svc-split--rev{grid-template-columns:1fr;}}
.cs-nav{display:flex;gap:0.5rem;}
.cs-nav__btn{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--cm-ink-800);border:1px solid var(--cm-border-strong);color:var(--cm-text-strong);font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1;cursor:pointer;transition:background var(--dur-2),color var(--dur-2);}
.cs-nav__btn:hover{background:var(--cm-accent);color:var(--cm-accent-contrast);border-color:var(--cm-accent);}
.cs-scroll{display:flex;gap:clamp(1.2rem,2.5vw,2rem);overflow-x:auto;scroll-snap-type:x mandatory;-webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch;margin-top:1.8rem;padding-bottom:1rem;scrollbar-width:thin;}
.cs-card{flex:0 0 min(92%,560px);scroll-snap-align:start;}
.cs-card__media image-slot{width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:4/3;}
.cs-card h3{margin-top:1.2rem;font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:var(--w-semibold);color:var(--cm-text-strong);letter-spacing:-0.01em;}
.cs-card .svc-checklist{margin-top:0.8rem;}
.svc-faq{max-width:68ch;}
.svc-faq .faq-list{border-top:1px solid var(--cm-line-faint);margin-top:1.8rem;}
.svc-faq .faq-item{border-bottom:1px solid var(--cm-line-faint);}
.svc-faq .faq-item p a{color:inherit;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;text-decoration-color:var(--cm-border-strong);transition:text-decoration-color var(--dur-2);}
.svc-faq .faq-item p a:hover{text-decoration-color:currentColor;}
.svc-faq .faq-item summary{list-style:none;cursor:pointer;padding:1.3rem 0;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:2rem;align-items:center;font-family:var(--font-display);font-weight:var(--w-semibold);font-size:1rem;color:var(--cm-text-strong);}
.svc-faq .faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none;}
.svc-faq .faq-item .pm{position:relative;width:16px;height:16px;flex:none;}
.svc-faq .faq-item .pm::before,.svc-faq .faq-item .pm::after{content:"";position:absolute;background:var(--cm-silver);transition:transform var(--dur-3);}
.svc-faq .faq-item .pm::before{top:7.5px;left:0;width:16px;height:1.5px;}
.svc-faq .faq-item .pm::after{top:0;left:7.5px;width:1.5px;height:16px;}
.svc-faq .faq-item[open] .pm::after{transform:scaleY(0);}
.svc-faq .faq-item p{margin-top:0;padding:0 0 1.3rem;color:var(--cm-text-muted);}
</style>
</Fragment>

<main>
<div class="container breadcrumb"><a href="/architectural-scale-models">← Architectural scale models</a></div>

<section class="page-hero"><div class="container">
  <div class="page-hero__inner">
    <div>
      <span class="eyebrow">Services / Architecture &amp; Real Estate</span>
      <h1 class="display-lg measure">Design<br><em>Competition</em><br>Models</h1>
      <p class="lead measure">Develop the model alongside the design.</p>
      <p class="muted measure" style="margin-top:1.2rem;">Carve Model works with designers to turn preliminary concepts into physical models for architectural competitions. We help develop the information needed for fabrication, explore materials and finishes, and plan for revisions within the submission schedule.</p>
      <div class="hero__cta">
        <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/contact">Get a Preliminary Estimate <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg" href="/works">View Our Work <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="page-hero__visual reveal">
      <span class="corner tl"></span><span class="corner br"></span>
      <image-slot id="dc-hero" placeholder="Drop design competition model photo" src="/assets/design-competition.webp"></image-slot>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="svc-section"><div class="container">
  <span class="eyebrow">Early start</span>
  <h2>Start before every detail is resolved</h2>
  <div class="svc-split svc-split--rev" style="margin-top:1.2rem;">
    <div>
      <p class="lead-p muted" style="margin-top:0;">Competition projects often begin with incomplete geometry and an evolving design. You can start the conversation with sketches, concept drawings, renderings or preliminary 3D files.</p>
      <p class="muted" style="margin-top:1rem;">We review what is available and identify:</p>
      <ul class="svc-checklist">
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> What is sufficiently defined to fabricate.</li>
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> What needs clarification or further development.</li>
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Which elements can be simplified at the chosen scale.</li>
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Where assumptions require the designer’s approval.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="svc-note">When production-ready geometry is missing, digital model development can be scoped separately. Design decisions remain with your team.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="svc-split__media"><image-slot id="dc-start" placeholder="Drop a project photo" src="/assets/type-concept.webp"></image-slot></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="svc-section"><div class="container">
  <span class="eyebrow">Schedule</span>
  <h2>Work to the competition deadline</h2>
  <div class="svc-split" style="margin-top:1.2rem;">
    <div>
      <p class="lead-p muted" style="margin-top:0;">We plan the scope around the submission date, review milestones and delivery requirements.</p>
      <p class="muted" style="margin-top:1rem;">Early coordination helps establish which elements can progress first and which should remain flexible while the design develops. The fabrication approach is selected to support the required presentation within the time available.</p>
      <p class="muted" style="margin-top:1rem;">Share the competition’s model requirements at the outset, including:</p>
      <ul class="svc-checklist">
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Permitted scale and dimensions.</li>
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Base, material or color restrictions.</li>
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Labeling and anonymity requirements.</li>
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Submission, transport and handling instructions.</li>
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Final delivery deadline.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="svc-note">Turnaround is confirmed after reviewing the design information and scope.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="svc-split__media"><image-slot id="dc-deadline" placeholder="Drop a project photo" src="/assets/type-planning.webp"></image-slot></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="svc-section"><div class="container">
  <span class="eyebrow">Revisions</span>
  <h2>Allow for changes across review rounds</h2>
  <div class="svc-split svc-split--rev" style="margin-top:1.2rem;">
    <div>
      <p class="lead-p muted" style="margin-top:0;">A competition model may need to evolve through several design reviews. We discuss likely changes before fabrication so construction can accommodate revisions where practical.</p>
      <p class="muted" style="margin-top:1rem;">Depending on the design, this may include:</p>
      <ul class="svc-checklist">
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Replaceable building or façade components.</li>
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Removable sections.</li>
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Separate site and architectural assemblies.</li>
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Delaying final attachment of elements still under review.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="svc-note">Some changes will still require remaking parts. Revision checkpoints help the team understand how each change affects fabrication, cost and the remaining schedule.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="svc-split__media" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:0.75rem;"><image-slot id="dc-changes-1" placeholder="Drop a project photo" src="/assets/revision-1.webp" style="aspect-ratio:4/3;"></image-slot><image-slot id="dc-changes-2" placeholder="Drop a project photo" src="/assets/revision-2.webp" style="aspect-ratio:4/3;"></image-slot><image-slot id="dc-changes-final" placeholder="Drop a project photo" src="/assets/design-competition.webp" style="aspect-ratio:4/3;grid-column:1/-1;"></image-slot></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="svc-section"><div class="container">
  <span class="eyebrow">Materials</span>
  <h2>Test materials and finishes together</h2>
  <div class="svc-split" style="margin-top:1.2rem;">
    <div>
      <p class="lead-p muted" style="margin-top:0;">Material choices influence how the design reads at model scale. We work with designers to review options for color, texture, transparency and contrast.</p>
      <p class="muted" style="margin-top:1rem;">Where useful and feasible within the schedule, samples or small mockups can help compare finishes before they are applied to the full model.</p>
      <p class="muted" style="margin-top:1rem;">The aim is to support the architectural idea with a consistent material treatment and an appropriate level of detail.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="svc-split__media"><image-slot id="dc-materials" placeholder="Drop a project photo" src="/assets/material-test.webp" style="aspect-ratio:1400/836;"></image-slot></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="svc-section"><div class="container">
  <span class="eyebrow">Design intent</span>
  <h2>Keep the design intent clear</h2>
  <div class="svc-split svc-split--rev" style="margin-top:1.2rem;">
    <div>
      <p class="lead-p muted" style="margin-top:0;">A competition model does not need to reproduce every detail equally. It needs to communicate the proposal.</p>
      <p class="muted" style="margin-top:1rem;">We work with your team to determine how the model should express:</p>
      <ul class="svc-checklist">
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Massing and proportion.</li>
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Site relationships and circulation.</li>
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Façade rhythm and material character.</li>
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Interior or sectional relationships.</li>
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Landscape and public space.</li>
        <li><svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> The concept’s defining architectural features.</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="svc-note">Fabrication may combine laser cutting, 3D printing, hand assembly and finishing according to the design and schedule.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="svc-split__media"><image-slot id="dc-intent" placeholder="Drop a project photo" src="/assets/design-intent.webp" style="aspect-ratio:4/3;"></image-slot></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="svc-section"><div class="container">
  <span class="eyebrow">Delivery</span>
  <h2>Plan the final presentation and delivery</h2>
  <div class="svc-split" style="margin-top:1.2rem;">
    <div>
      <p class="lead-p muted" style="margin-top:0;">The schedule needs to accommodate final assembly, quality review, photography where required, packing and delivery.</p>
      <p class="muted" style="margin-top:1rem;">We review handling and packaging early, particularly for delicate features, unusual bases or models that must travel to a jury presentation or exhibition.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="svc-split__media"><image-slot id="dc-delivery" placeholder="Drop a project photo" src="/assets/svc-arch-support.webp"></image-slot></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="svc-section" style="border-bottom:0;"><div class="container">
  <span class="eyebrow">Send us</span>
  <h2>Start your competition model</h2>
  <div class="formats">
    <div class="fmt">The competition brief and model requirements</div>
    <div class="fmt">Current sketches, drawings, renderings or 3D files</div>
    <div class="fmt">The concept and features the model should emphasize</div>
    <div class="fmt">Proposed scale, dimensions and material direction</div>
    <div class="fmt">Review dates and anticipated areas of change</div>
    <div class="fmt">Submission deadline and delivery location</div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="section"><div class="container">
  <div class="cta reveal" style="position:relative;text-align:center;background:var(--cm-black);border:1px solid var(--cm-border);border-radius:var(--r-sm);padding:clamp(3rem,6vw,5rem) var(--gutter);">
    <h2 class="display-md">Start your competition model.</h2>
    <p class="muted mt-2" style="max-width:52ch;margin-inline:auto;">We will review what is ready, identify the next information needed and propose a fabrication approach for your schedule.</p>
    <div class="hero__cta" style="justify-content:center;margin-top:2.4rem;">
      <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="/contact">Get a Preliminary Estimate <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
      <a class="btn btn--ghost btn--lg" href="/architectural-scale-models">Architectural Model Services <span class="arrow">→</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></section>
